dateTime":"2026-10-18T13:15:00-04:00","description":"Ladies, join us for a beautiful autumn brunch at the historic Old Mill on Sunday, October 18th.\n\nWe’ll enjoy their all-you-can-eat brunch, surrounded by the gorgeous fall colours along the Humber River. After brunch, anyone who’s up for it can take a little stroll along the river trails.\n\nI’m looking forward to great food, great conversation, and lots of laughter with wonderful women.\n\nPrice (tax \u0026 18% gratuity included) -$95.00\n\nPLEASE READ:\nSIGN-UP PROCESS\nSTEPS:\nHow Our New Process Works:\n\nRSVP to Join Waitlist\n\n* When you RSVP, you'll be added to our waitlist, which is your way of expressing interest in joining us.\nSecure Your Spot\n\n* E-transfer $95.00 to: fabulousover50@hotmail.com. Include the event name in your message. If your email name differs from your Meetup profile, please let me know. Please note, $95.00 is non refundable or non transferable\n\nConfirmation\n\n* Once payment is received, I'll move you from the waitlist to \"going\" - spots are secured in order of payment received.\n\nEvent Capacity\n\n* When maximum capacity is reached, RSVPs will close. Please stay on the waitlist as spots may open due to cancellations.\n\nManage Your RSVP\n\n* If plans change, please remove yourself from the waitlist to allow others the opportunity to join.\n\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\nPOSITIVE GROUP POLICIES\n\nMeet Someone New:\n\nEvery meetup is a chance to make a new friend! We encourage everyone to sit with someone different each time.\n\nOpen Seating\n* Seats are first come, first serve - no saving seats. This helps everyone feel welcome and included.\nWarm Welcome\n* If you see someone new or alone, invite them to join your table or conversation.\nPositive Vibes Only\n* We celebrate kindness, encouragement, and support in all our interactions.\nRespectful Listening\n* Everyone's voice matters. Listen with respect \u0026 curiosity.\n\nLet's make every meetup a chance to expand our circle of friends.\n\nA smile and a hello can make someone's day - let's be that person for each other.\n\nTrying something new can be scary - thank-you for being brave and open to meeting new people! We are all here to connect, so let's make sure no one feels left out!\n\nWarmest Regards\nMirella","eventType":"PHYSICAL","eventUrl":"https://www.meetup.com/north-york-55-womens-group/events/313929547/","isAttending":false,"isSaved":false,"maxTickets":1,"rsvpState":"JOIN_APPROVAL","featuredEventPhoto":{"__ref":"PhotoInfo:533367421"},"displayPhoto":{"__ref":"PhotoInfo:533367421"},"feeSettings":{"__typename":"EventFeeSettings","accepts":"CASH","currency":"CAD","amount":95},"group":{"__ref":"Group:36691184"},"socialProofInsights":null,"rsvps":{"__typename":"RsvpConnection","totalCount":5,"edges":[{"__typename":"RsvpEdge","node":{"__typename":"Rsvp","isHost":false,"member":{"__ref":"Member:286447731"}}},{"__typename":"RsvpEdge","node":{"__typename":"Rsvp","isHost":true,"member":{"__ref":"Member:42731942"}}},{"__typename":"RsvpEdge","node":{"__typename":"Rsvp","isHost":false,"member":{"__ref":"Member:423285371"}}},{"__typename":"RsvpEdge","node":{"__typename":"Rsvp","isHost":false,"member":{"__ref":"Member:35199172"}}},{"__typename":"RsvpEdge","node":{"__typename":"Rsvp","isHost":false,"member":{"__ref":"Member:482064215"}}}]},"series":null,"venue":{"__typename":"Venue","name":"Old Mill","address":"21 Old Mill Rd","city":"Toronto","state":"ON","country":"ca"}},"RecommendedEventsEdge:{\"node\":{\"id\":\"313929547\"}}":{"__typename":"RecommendedEventsEdge","node":{"__ref":"Event:313929547","id":"313929547"},"metadata":{"__typename":"SearchMetadata","recId":"78fafd0f-4009-49af-b6d5-21f14f2897ed","recSource":"ml-popular-events-nearby-offline"}},"PhotoInfo:514811991":{"__typename":"PhotoInfo","baseUrl":"https://secure-content.meetupstatic.com/images/classic-events/","highResUrl":"https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/2/e/d/7/highres_514811991.jpeg","id":"514811991"},"PhotoInfo:512039031":{"__typename":"PhotoInfo","baseUrl":"https://secure-content.meetupstatic.com/images/classic-events/","highResUrl":"https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/e/6/9/7/highres_512039031.jpeg","id":"512039031"},"Group:5774262":{"__typename":"Group","id":"5774262","name":"Toronto Movies \u0026 Social Group - Celebrating 14 Years!","urlname":"toronto-movies-and-social-group","timezone":"America/Toronto","keyGroupPhoto":{"__ref":"PhotoInfo:512039031"},"stats":{"__typename":"GroupStats","eventRatings":{"__typename":"GroupStatsEventRatings","average":4.75,"totalRatings":6972}}},"PhotoInfo:316235363":{"__typename":"PhotoInfo","id":"316235363","highResUrl":"https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/member/8/a/2/3/highres_316235363.jpeg","baseUrl":"https://secure-content.meetupstatic.com/images/classic-member/"},"PhotoInfo:299195658":{"__typename":"PhotoInfo","id":"299195658","highResUrl":"https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/member/8/b/4/a/highres_299195658.jpeg","baseUrl":"https://secure-content.meetupstatic.com/images/classic-member/"},"PhotoInfo:276945686":{"__typename":"PhotoInfo","id":"276945686","highResUrl":"https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/member/b/2/7/6/highres_276945686.jpeg","baseUrl":"https://secure-content.meetupstatic.com/images/classic-member/"},"PhotoInfo:1700124":{"__typename":"PhotoInfo","id":"1700124","highResUrl":"https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/member/4/e/9/c/highres_1700124.jpeg","baseUrl":"https://secure-content.meetupstatic.com/images/classic-member/"},"PhotoInfo:264462704":{"__typename":"PhotoInfo","id":"264462704","highResUrl":"https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/member/a/6/d/0/highres_264462704.jpeg","baseUrl":"https://secure-content.meetupstatic.com/images/classic-member/"},"PhotoInfo:77576192":{"__typename":"PhotoInfo","id":"77576192","highResUrl":"https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/member/d/b/8/0/highres_77576192.jpeg","baseUrl":"https://secure-content.meetupstatic.com/images/classic-member/"},"PhotoInfo:1102060":{"__typename":"PhotoInfo","id":"1102060","highResUrl":"https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/member/5/6/2/c/highres_1102060.jpeg","baseUrl":"https://secure-content.meetupstatic.com/images/classic-member/"},"PhotoInfo:312069412":{"__typename":"PhotoInfo","id":"312069412","highResUrl":"https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/member/2/4/c/4/highres_312069412.jpeg","baseUrl":"https://secure-content.meetupstatic.com/images/classic-member/"},"Member:9334356":{"__typename":"Member","id":"9334356","name":"Mathew","memberPhoto":{"__ref":"PhotoInfo:312069412"}},"Member:267447852":{"__typename":"Member","id":"267447852","name":"Joanna C","memberPhoto":{"__ref":"PhotoInfo:316235363"}},"Member:34264362":{"__typename":"Member","id":"34264362","name":"Nesia","memberPhoto":{"__ref":"PhotoInfo:299195658"}},"Event:316183191":{"__typename":"Event","id":"316183191","title":" 🌿 FALL WALK -  Walk: Tommy Thompson Park (Come See The Skyline) 🐦 - 12KM","dateTime":"2026-10-18T11:00:00-04:00","description":"# 🍂🐦 Fall Walk: Tommy Thompson Park 🌊\n\n### Wildlife, Lake Views \u0026 One of Toronto's Best Fall Walks\n\nLooking for a walk that feels like you've left the city without actually leaving Toronto?\n\nJoin us for a fall walk through **Tommy Thompson Park**, one of Toronto's most unique outdoor spaces.\nThe park is famous for its wildlife and birding, with **more than 300 species recorded**, as well as its beautiful views across Lake Ontario and back toward the Toronto skyline.\nIn the fall, the cooler air and quieter trails make this a particularly nice time to explore the park. We'll follow the trails toward the **lighthouse**, take a break along the way, and then make our way back.\n\nIt's a **long walk**, but the terrain is generally easy. The goal is to enjoy the scenery, get some fresh air, and spend a few hours walking and talking with other people.\n\n📱 Don't forget to join our **WhatsApp Group – [CLICK HERE](https://chat.whatsapp.com/H59mSCbsAi018gYANrKAnc)**\n\n***\n\n## 🚶‍♂️ What We'll Do\n\nWe'll meet near the pavilion and begin our walk through Tommy Thompson Park.\n\nAlong the way we'll:\n\n* Explore the park's trails 🌿\n* Look for birds and other wildlife 🐦\n* Enjoy views of Lake Ontario 🌊\n* Take in the Toronto skyline 🌆\n* Make our way toward the lighthouse\n* Stop for a break and some photos 📸\n* Loop back to the pavilion\n\nThe walk will take approximately **3 hours, including a break**.\nThis is a longer walk, so you should be comfortable walking at a steady pace for several hours.\n**No dogs are permitted in the park.**\n\n***\n\n## 🍁 Fall Weather \u0026 Expectations\n\nThis is an outdoor walk, and Tommy Thompson can be exposed to the wind coming off Lake Ontario.\nPlease dress appropriately for the weather and bring comfortable walking shoes.\n\nThe trail isn't particularly difficult, but **the distance is the challenge**. If you're not comfortable being on your feet and walking steadily for around three hours, this may not be the right walk for you.\n\n***\n\n## 🧢 Meetup Details\n\n📍 **Meetup Location:** Near the pavilion and bathrooms\n🫎 **Look for me in my Moose Hat!**\n⏰ **Meetup Time: 11:00 AM sharp**\nI will only wait **5 minutes.**\n**Early is on time. On time is late.**\n🏁 **End Point:** Tommy Thompson Park Pavilion\n\n***\n\n## 🎟️ Meetup Fee\n\n**$5 cash in person or e-transfer**\n📧 **mathewmaclean@hotmail.com**\nThis fee helps support the group and allows us to continue organizing events throughout Toronto.\n\n***\n\n## 🍔 After the Walk\n\nOnce we've finished, you're welcome to join us for lunch at **Wendy's or Tim Hortons** nearby.\nIt's completely optional, but it's a great chance to sit down, refuel, and continue the conversation after the walk.\n\n***\n\n## 🎒 What to Bring\n\n💧 Water\n👟 Comfortable walking shoes\n🥪 A snack\n🧥 A fall jacket or sweater\n📸 Camera or phone for photos\n\n***\n\n## 🌈 Who Is This For?\n\nThis walk is great for:\n\n* People who enjoy nature and wildlife 🐦\n* Anyone interested in birdwatching\n* People who love waterfront walks\n* Anyone looking for a longer social walk\n* People who want to explore somewhere different in Toronto\n* Anyone who enjoys getting outside and meeting new people\n\nThe activity is the container. **The people you meet along the way are the real experience.**\n\nYou're welcome to RSVP ahead of time or just show up on the day if you're unsure about your schedule.\nSometimes things happen and events may need to be cancelled or changed, so please keep an eye on the event page for updates.\n\n👤 **Organizer: Mathew**\n\nQuestions? Post on the event wall or email **torontomoviesandoutings@hotmail.com**\n\n**Come for the wildlife.** 🐦\n**Stay for the conversation.**\n**Leave with a new connection — and maybe a new friend.** 🍂💛","eventType":"PHYSICAL","eventUrl":"https://www.meetup.com/toronto-movies-and-social-group/events/316183191/","isAttending":false,"isSaved":false,"maxTickets":0,"rsvpState":"JOIN_OPEN","featuredEventPhoto":{"__ref":"PhotoInfo:514811991"},"displayPhoto":{"__ref":"PhotoInfo:514811991"},"feeSettings":{"__typename":"EventFeeSettings","accepts":"CASH","currency":"CAD","amount":5},"group":{"__ref":"Group:5774262"},"socialProofInsights":{"__typename":"SocialProofInsights","isTrendingEvent":false,"totalInterestedUsers":44,"interestedUsersSample":[{"__typename":"Member","memberPhoto":{"__ref":"PhotoInfo:316235363"}},{"__typename":"Member","memberPhoto":{"__ref":"PhotoInfo:299195658"}},{"__typename":"Member","memberPhoto":{"__ref":"PhotoInfo:276945686"}},{"__typename":"Member","memberPhoto":{"__ref":"PhotoInfo:1700124"}},{"__typename":"Member","memberPhoto":{"__ref":"PhotoInfo:264462704"}},{"__typename":"Member","memberPhoto":{"__ref":"PhotoInfo:77576192"}},{"__typename":"Member","memberPhoto":{"__ref":"PhotoInfo:1102060"}}]},"rsvps":{"__typename":"RsvpConnection","totalCount":3,"edges":[{"__typename":"RsvpEdge","n